Hi Vivek,

Apache Kafka 4.3.1 is already released and won't get changed after the
fact. Our binaries are immutable. What I can tell you is that both
branches, 4.2 and 4.3 contain the updated dependencies, so subsequent
releases in these both version families will include it.
At the time of writing this, there is no planned date yet for 4.3.2 or
4.2.2, sorry.


Best,

