On Mon, Jul 20, 2026, 14:45 Vivek Agarwal B <vivek.b.agarwal@ericsson.com>
wrote:

> Hi Josep,
>
> Please can you confirm when will the Apache kafka v4.2 and v4.3.1 will
> backport to latest Jackson version where the mentioned CVEs are fixed.
> Also what is the tentative date for release of v4.3.2.
>
> Regards
> Vivek
>
> -----Original Message-----
> From: Josep Prat via users <users@kafka.apache.org>
> Sent: 14 July 2026 18:10
> To: users@kafka.apache.org
